{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assume the role of Autonomous Strategic Mobile Projectile No. 100 (hereinafter referred to as &quot;No. 100&quot;) and strive to conquer the Facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How to Navigate the Floors:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754640/extras/FIREBALL_gif_operation.gif?t=1753263318\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Touch the black objects to charge energy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this state, press the button to build power and release to launch toward the pointer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(You can launch up to two times with a single charge.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress to the next area by leaping between black objects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Once you reach the goal area, launch No. 100 into the goal to clear the floor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NOTE:Some floors may differ from these rules. Adapt as needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize various gimmicks and physical laws to conquer each floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Clear all 15 floors within the time limit to conquer the Facility.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff0aThe demo version is limited to the 5th floor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;If you conquer the Facility, I will grant you one wish.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;I want to see the outside world.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No. 100\u2019s challenge begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754640?t=1753263318","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754640?t=1753263318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754640/71cbdc87210a4e2f2cd318edda54293d34f875e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753263318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754640/71cbdc87210a4e2f2cd318edda54293d34f875e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753263318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assume the role of Autonomous Strategic Mobile Projectile No. 100 (hereinafter referred to as &quot;No. 100&quot;) and strive to conquer the Facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How to Navigate the Floors:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754640/extras/FIREBALL_gif_operation.gif?t=1753263318\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Touch the black objects to charge energy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this state, press the button to build power and release to launch toward the pointer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(You can launch up to two times with a single charge.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress to the next area by leaping between black objects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Once you reach the goal area, launch No. 100 into the goal to clear the floor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NOTE:Some floors may differ from these rules. Adapt as needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize various gimmicks and physical laws to conquer each floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Clear all 15 floors within the time limit to conquer the Facility.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff0aThe demo version is limited to the 5th floor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;If you conquer the Facility, I will grant you one wish.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;I want to see the outside world.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No. 100\u2019s challenge begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["TONGARI GAMES"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3355900","name":"FIREBALL"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754640/cd79f38722bdadf0f031c3e82c0b764fe54a000c/header.jpg?t=1753263318","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257141161,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141161/movie480.mp4?t=1753263316","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141161/movie_max.mp4?t=1753263316"},"name":"PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257141161/83567ca479e5d8fc2fd0677b7cf393e300c5bff6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753263316","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141161/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753263316","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141161/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753263316"}}],"name":"FIREBALL Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 Q720<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:<